  Protected *This_vt.UI_TreeNode_vt = *This
        *This\renderY = y_p
        *This\renderH = h_p
        *This\rowW = w_p
        *This\level = level_p
        *This\expandX = expX_p
        *This\expandY = expY_p
        *This\expandSize = expSize_p
        *This\checkX = chkX_p
        *This\checkY = chkY_p
        *This\checkSize = chkSize_p
EndProcedure

